    {
      "author": "Sierbahnn",
      "content": "It offers no real substance, but he packaging is pretty, and the character engaging, just in the most annoying way possible. This was like the most infuriatingly shallow version of The Craft crossed with the most unfunny version of Legally Blonde I could imagine. I cannot fault how it looks, or how it is played, directed, or shot. Only how it is written.",
